3,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e38a49876c5701109","kind":"glyph","char":"our convergence analysis does not apply to non-convex problems, we empirically found that Adam","font":"NimbusRomNo9L-Regu","bbox":[104.96,430.94,490.32,440.64],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ec52ee889ea3ab963","kind":"glyph","char":"often outperforms other methods in such cases. In our experiments, we made model choices that are","font":"NimbusRomNo9L-Regu","bbox":[104.96,441.61,490.32,451.3],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e179a4e2826fc40d6","kind":"glyph","char":"consistent with previous publications in the area; a neural network model with two fully connected","font":"NimbusRomNo9L-Regu","bbox":[104.96,452.27,490.32,461.96],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e0f476ba0eadc626d","kind":"glyph","char":"hidden layers with 1000 hidden units each and ReLU activation are used for this experiment with","font":"NimbusRomNo9L-Regu","bbox":[104.96,462.93,490.32,472.63],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e0200a7ffcab1ceef","kind":"glyph","char":"minibatch size of 128.","font":"NimbusRomNo9L-Regu","bbox":[104.96,473.6,191.13,483.29],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"ebcdbab30759eedb9","kind":"glyph","char":"First, we study different optimizers using the standard deterministic cross-entropy objective func-","font":"NimbusRomNo9L-Regu","bbox":[104.96,490.08,490.32,499.77],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"e4cffbea8dd9397f9","kind":"glyph","char":"tion with","font":"NimbusRomNo9L-Regu","bbox":[104.96,500.74,140.31,510.44],"pathHash":"","ordinal":0,"label":"text","confidence":0.93,"rule":"body-font"},{"id":"eca7a5db0289872a1","kind":"glyph","char":"L","font":"CMMI10","bbox":[143.33,500.74,149.93,510.